From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juan Sanchez Fuentes <juanesf91@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:15:00 -0300
Subject: sunxi: dram: a523: use exported 2 GiB TPR values on cubie-a5e

Use the DRAM parameters exported from a 2 GiB radxa-cubie-a5e board.
Keep the PR 10694 values as the first retry for 1 GiB boards.
Keep the original defconfig values as the second retry.
Keep the vendor BOOT0 values from a v1.2 2 GiB board as the third retry.

Signed-off-by: Juan Sanchez Fuentes <juanesf91@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: opencode:big-pickle
---
 configs/radxa-cubie-a5e_defconfig | 22 +++++++++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/configs/radxa-cubie-a5e_defconfig b/configs/radxa-cubie-a5e_defconfig
index 7efd123b03c..cc794843a7c 100644
--- a/configs/radxa-cubie-a5e_defconfig
+++ b/configs/radxa-cubie-a5e_defconfig
@@ -8,16 +8,28 @@ CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_CA_DRI=0x0e0e
 CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_ODT_EN=0x84848484
 CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR0=0x80808080
 CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR1=0x06060606
-CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR6=0x38000000
-CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR10=0x802f3333
-CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR11=0xc7c5c4c2
-CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR12=0x3533302f
-# Alternative parameters, used when the built-in DRAM memory check fails
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR6=0x3a000000
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR10=0x882f3333
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR11=0xd4d2d4d4
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR12=0x34312c2d
+# Alternative parameters from PR 10694, used first when the primary set fails
 CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR_ALT_PARAMETERS=y
 CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR6_ALT=0x3a000000
 CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR10_ALT=0x882f3333
 CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR11_ALT=0xe6e6e2e3
 CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR12_ALT=0x38383031
+# Original parameters, used when the alternative set also fails
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR_ORIG_PARAMETERS=y
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR6_ORIG=0x38000000
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR10_ORIG=0x802f3333
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR11_ORIG=0xc7c5c4c2
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR12_ORIG=0x3533302f
+# Boot0 parameters from Cubie A5E v1.2 2 GiB, used when all other sets fail
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR_BOOT0_PARAMETERS=y
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR6_BOOT0=0x3a000000
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR10_BOOT0=0x802f3333
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR11_BOOT0=0xc0c0bbbf
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR12_BOOT0=0x35352f31
 CONFIG_MACH_SUN55I_A523=y
 CONFIG_MMC_SUNXI_SLOT_EXTRA=2
 CONFIG_R_I2C_ENABLE=y
